&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Cloud Platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past Work in Early-Stage SaaS or Startups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of Kubernetes or containerized infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
