&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft personalized outbound outreach&lt;/strong&gt; (email, calls, LinkedIn) to engage decision-makers across engineering, DevOps, and cloud teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with AEs&lt;/strong&gt; to align on territory plans, account lists, and ideal customer profiles (ICPs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain pipeline hygiene&lt;/strong&gt; in the CRM, tracking activity and outcomes for reporting and feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
